<title>POLAND: WOLCZANAKA SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>WOLCZANAKA SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> SEPTEMBER		1996	1995</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.11 vs   0.31</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.40 vs   0.62</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.32 vs   0.42</p>
<p> Sales		    6.94 vs   5.79</p>
<p> JANUARY-SEPTEMBER    1996	1995</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.99 vs   4.54</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.04 vs   8.30</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.22 vs   6.30</p>
<p> Sales		   64.12 vs  55.96</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Wolczanka SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
